OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfter a
OL,6,Fburst of heavy showers, it will dry up
OL,7,Ffor most in the evening with only the
OL,8,Fodd light shower remaining overnight.
OL,9,FA very windy night with occasional
OL,10,Fgales inland, stronger still along
OL,11,Fcoasts and for exposed high ground.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FStrong, perhaps disruptive
OL,14,Fwinds throughout the day, easing to a
OL,15,Fbrisk breeze by the evening. Perhaps a
OL,16,Flight shower during the morning but
OL,17,Fsunny intervals otherwise.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
